          "text": " Kandi omuntu aryaba atakyegyesa mutaahi we nari mwene ishe, naamugira ati: Manya MUKAMA; ahabw'okuba boona baryammanya okuruga aha muto okuhika aha mukuru; ahakuba ndyabasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo, n'ekibi kyabo tindikiijuka bundi; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.",
